<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 3Com raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 3Com raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said it upgraded 3Com Corp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Chris Stix was not immediately available to provide additional details.</p>
<p>-- 3Com gained 1/2 to 49.</p>
</text>
